%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: companionquest2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you ready to keep moving, Shield-Sister?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749434
    - rid: 4351267988772749435
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, let's get moving-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749438
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749439
    - rid: 4351267988772749440
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}?!?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749441
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure if you guys can hear this, but...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you see one of those word walls, like the one I stared at back before
      I got a concussion at Bleak Falls Barrow-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749443
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Could you write down what they say? From left to right, then top to bottom,
      like how you usually read.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Also, let's meet up in Riverwood in... uh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You know what, if you can hear this, I'll just yell out when we should
      meet up. Send a letter if you can't make it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... so, assuming they heard me, how do I stop thi-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749444
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, what just happened?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749445
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That was my friend, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749447
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess that dummy really figured out how to talk long distances!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749448
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... was that the friend who told you about our secret?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749449
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's get lookin' for that key, Farkas.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749450
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The two of them begin looking, and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, Farkas, is this it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749451
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Probably. Where did you find it?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Just in this chest over here- not exactly the most secretive place...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749452
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, you can't always be so lucky. We should be grateful.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: If you say so.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749453
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Using the key, Natsuki unlocks and opens the door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah great, more spiders...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749455
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: At least these ones aren't huge, right Farkas?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749456
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749457
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki turns to get a better look at Farkas.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh you gotta be kidding me, not you too...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749458
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas, please don't tell me you're scared of spiders.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749459
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... so what if I am...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749460
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, fine, let's just run through here then.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749461
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't gotta deal with the "oh-so scary" spiders that way.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749462
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... fine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749463
    - rid: 4351267988772749464
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749465
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's one of those word walls back there...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, a bit of a long shot, but do you have any paper, Farkas?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749466
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, seriously?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749467
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah? How else am I supposed to wipe my-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749468
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ew! Ew! Ew! Shut up shut up shut up!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Is your paper clean?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749469
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, duh, why would I keep it around if it's already been used-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749470
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749471
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, just quit talking about <i>that</i> and hand it over.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749472
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, you're going to write down what's on that wall, like your friend
      said?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749473
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas hands over his... paper. As he does so-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749474
    - rid: 4351267988772749475
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, there's the fragment of Wuuthrad, up on that altar.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Neat. Quit distracting me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki finishes her transcription in silence.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, now that I've taken care of that, let's grab that thing and
      get out of here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749476
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki grabs the fragment of Wuuthrad, and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Draugr start popping out of the sarcophaguses that litter the room.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749477
    - rid: 4351267988772749478
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You've got to be kidding me, we're this close to leaving and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749479
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah crap, that's a lot of them...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749480
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas transforms into his werewolf form, to try and even the odds...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749481
    - rid: 4351268438874521936
    - rid: 268099459762618370
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=5>Awooo</SineText>!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: In spite of her seeming distaste for all things werewolf, Natsuki sticks
      close by to the transformed Farkas...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749482
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749483
    - rid: 4351267988772749484
    - rid: 4351267988772749485
    - rid: 4351267988772749486
